{"id": "yuki-personal-pc-studio", "category": "Entrepreneurship", "title": "Yuki Personal PC Studio", "subtitle": "My first e-commerce venture, and the one I am proudest of.", "cover": {"src": "/assets/experience/cover-yuki-studio.png", "width": 596, "height": 493, "scale": 1, "srcset": "/assets/responsive/cover-yuki-studio-40642fc69d12-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/cover-yuki-studio-40642fc69d12-596.webp 596w"}, "html": "<section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Finding an opportunity in an unmet need</h3><p>As classes moved online during the pandemic, students began buying computers and accessories. While shopping in Akihabara, I noticed that some Chinese-speaking residents struggled to explain their requirements in Japanese and instead bought prebuilt computers. I saw an opportunity to offer custom assembly with communication in Chinese.</p></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Learning the technical work and starting an e-commerce business</h3><p>When the pandemic disrupted the bubble tea business, I began learning computer assembly through YouTube. About a month later, I started a studio offering custom assembly services to Chinese-speaking customers in Japan.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-motherboard-assembly.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-motherboard-assembly.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-motherboard-assembly-bb8dac6ff344-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-motherboard-assembly-bb8dac6ff344-544.webp 544w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"An assembly detail showing the motherboard, memory, and CPU water block.\" width=\"544\" height=\"717\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>An assembly detail showing the motherboard, memory, and CPU water block.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-component-stock.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-component-stock.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-component-stock-bee300e23a82-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-component-stock-bee300e23a82-542.webp 542w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Processors, motherboards, and graphics cards in the studio.\" width=\"542\" height=\"719\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Processors, motherboards, and graphics cards in the studio.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-parts-delivery.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-parts-delivery.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-parts-delivery-d2509446c35b-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-parts-delivery-d2509446c35b-541.webp 541w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"A delivery scene with boxed PC cases and components.\" width=\"541\" height=\"718\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A delivery scene with boxed PC cases and components.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-cpu-memory-assembly.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-cpu-memory-assembly.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-cpu-memory-assembly-fe3b0932f47a-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-cpu-memory-assembly-fe3b0932f47a-548.webp 548w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Assembly details showing the processor, motherboard, and memory.\" width=\"548\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Assembly details showing the processor, motherboard, and memory.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-in-progress-custom-build.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-in-progress-custom-build.png\" alt=\"A custom PC during assembly, shown with the original post.\" width=\"417\" height=\"719\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A custom PC during assembly, shown with the original post.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-white-case-assembly.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-white-case-assembly.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-white-case-assembly-dd150bee1371-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-white-case-assembly-dd150bee1371-695.webp 695w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Assembly and cable routing inside a white PC case.\" width=\"695\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Assembly and cable routing inside a white PC case.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Refining customer acquisition and positioning</h3><p>Finding customers and improving profitability were early challenges. I studied the habits of Chinese-speaking consumers in Japan and promoted the business through platforms they used, including WeChat, while adjusting the messaging and approach.</p><p>Over time, I moved toward high-end custom PCs. The change involved the service offering, logo, advertising copy, and visual identity, incorporating personal elements and gaming-inspired design.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-custom-water-cooled-pc.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-custom-water-cooled-pc.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-custom-water-cooled-pc-90c9381cb847-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-custom-water-cooled-pc-90c9381cb847-542.webp 542w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"A completed custom water-cooled PC.\" width=\"542\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A completed custom water-cooled PC.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-high-end-components.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-high-end-components.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-high-end-components-a3eef80f5b4b-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-high-end-components-a3eef80f5b4b-542.webp 542w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"A component selection for a high-end custom PC.\" width=\"542\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A component selection for a high-end custom PC.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-royal-elite-memory-detail.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-royal-elite-memory-detail.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-royal-elite-memory-detail-c49e38fe98a7-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-royal-elite-memory-detail-c49e38fe98a7-555.webp 555w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Premium memory modules with the studio’s branded card.\" width=\"555\" height=\"717\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Premium memory modules with the studio’s branded card.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>The first e-commerce venture I am proudest of</h3><p>This was my first e-commerce business connecting customer observation, technical learning, marketing, and daily operations. I learned that understanding how customers express their needs, find services, and decide whom to trust matters as much as the assembly work itself.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-graphics-card-stock.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-graphics-card-stock.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-graphics-card-stock-b95977db9035-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-graphics-card-stock-b95977db9035-540.webp 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Boxed graphics cards with the studio’s branded card.\" width=\"540\" height=\"717\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Boxed graphics cards with the studio’s branded card.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-workspace-inventory.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-workspace-inventory.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-workspace-inventory-cce4c9027168-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-workspace-inventory-cce4c9027168-543.webp 543w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"The studio workspace and component stock.\" width=\"543\" height=\"719\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>The studio workspace and component stock.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-workbench-components.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-workbench-components.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-workbench-components-745998e22548-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-workbench-components-745998e22548-541.webp 541w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"The workbench, shelving, and PC components.\" width=\"541\" height=\"718\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>The workbench, shelving, and PC components.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Shipping and community interactions</h3><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-dispatch-cart.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-dispatch-cart.png\" alt=\"A dispatch record showing boxed items being collected for delivery.\" width=\"461\" height=\"717\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A dispatch record showing boxed items being collected for delivery.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-packed-orders.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-packed-orders.png\" alt=\"PC shipping boxes with delivery labels attached.\" width=\"470\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>PC shipping boxes with delivery labels attached.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-courier-collection.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-courier-collection.png\" alt=\"A courier collecting the packed boxes.\" width=\"461\" height=\"717\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A courier collecting the packed boxes.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-community-inquiries-2021.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-community-inquiries-2021.png\" alt=\"A community discussion and product-inquiry screenshot dated April 14, 2021.\" width=\"321\" height=\"686\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A community discussion and product-inquiry screenshot dated April 14, 2021.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-customer-payment-chat.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-customer-payment-chat.png\" alt=\"A customer payment and conversation screenshot.\" width=\"414\" height=\"724\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A customer payment and conversation screenshot.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-account-statement-2020.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-account-statement-2020.png\" alt=\"A 2020 account statement and studio post.\" width=\"338\" height=\"691\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A 2020 account statement and studio post.</figcaption></figure></div></section>", "status": "published", "pending": "Full article coming soon.", "close": "Close"}